		<h1>2026 Governing Board Candidate Statements</h1>
		<p class="summary">Under ARS 15-421 (H), each candidate whose name has been certified to appear on the election ballot/write-in list may submit a statement not to exceed 500 words and a recent photograph.</p>
		<h4>
	<strong>Click on the name of the candidate to view their statement:</strong></h4>
<hr />
<p>
	<strong>Amphitheater Unified School District No. 10 Four-Year Term (2 seats)</strong></p>
<ul>
	<li>
		<a class="cf-file" href="https://www.schools.pima.gov/?ACT=25&amp;fid=5&amp;d=451&amp;f=slater_amphi.pdf" title="Elizabeth Slater">Elizabeth Slater</a></li>
	<li>
		<a class="cf-file" href="https://www.schools.pima.gov/?ACT=25&amp;fid=5&amp;d=451&amp;f=godlewski_amphi.pdf" title="Nina Godlewski">Nina Godlewski</a></li>
	<li>
		<a class="cf-file" href="https://www.schools.pima.gov/?ACT=25&amp;fid=5&amp;d=451&amp;f=fife_amphi.pdf" title="John Fife">John Fife</a></li>
</ul>
<p>
	<strong>Amphitheater Unified School District No. 10 Two-Year Term (1 seats)</strong></p>
<ul>
	<li>
		<a class="cf-file" href="https://www.schools.pima.gov/?ACT=25&amp;fid=5&amp;d=451&amp;f=gemma_amphi.pdf" title="Mike Gemma">Mike Gemma</a></li>
	<li>
		<a class="cf-file" href="https://www.schools.pima.gov/?ACT=25&amp;fid=5&amp;d=451&amp;f=outlaw_ryan_amphi.pdf" title="Kimberly Outlaw Ryan">Kimberly Outlaw Ryan</a></li>
</ul>
<p>
	<strong>Pima JTED - District 2 (1 seat)</strong></p>
<ul>
