	<li>
		<a class="cf-file" href="https://www.schools.pima.gov/?ACT=25&amp;fid=5&amp;d=451&amp;f=rankin_jted.pdf" title="Cindy Rankin Elliott">Cindy Rankin Elliott</a></li>
</ul>
<p>
	<strong>Sahuarita Unified School District No. 30 (2 seats)</strong></p>
